msgctxt "328"
msgid "Well if it ain't my star ass-kicker!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "...Uh, Kiryu-san? I can't teach more than one student at a time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "So tell your friend to beat it. Um... please."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid ""
"Well if it ain't my star ass-kicker! Ready to hone your ass-kickin' skills?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "Yeah. Let's fight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid ""
"...Wait. Uh... Bad news, Kiryu-san. You already know all my kick-ass ass-"
"kicking techniques."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid ""
"Huh? What about all the time you spend traveling the world and collecting "
"techniques?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "Yeah, see, that's kind of the problem."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr "Cosa intendi?"

msgctxt "436"
msgid ""
"All that time you spent rattling my noggin, I think you knocked something "
"loose. Or back into place. I remembered something."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "Cosa?"

msgctxt "460"
msgid ""
"I remembered what it was like to travel the world kickin' ass in exotic "
"locales with masters wielding exotic styles."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid ""
"I miss that life... But I haven't used the other techniques I've learned for"
" more than a decade, man. I couldn't teach 'em to you. I can barely even use"
" 'em."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid "I see... I'm sorry I pushed you, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid ""
"No way, man. I'm the one who should apologize. I'm too rusty. Gotta go "
"around Japan and the world and get my brain rattled again until I remember "
"everything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid "Thanks for everything, then. Where are you going next?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid ""
"One of my old teachers. A master of Chinese martial arts based out of Osaka."
" She's first on my list."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid ""
"Wow. I guess you really have traveled all over the place. Mind if I ask the "
"name of this master?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid ""
"What!? You're not supposed to talk about the underground, man! But hell, I "
"guess it wouldn't hurt. She goes by \"White Lotus,\" though she's gettin' on"
" in years."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "604"
msgid ""
"Hmm... You wouldn't happen to be talking about Granny White, would you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "616"
msgid "How the... You know her? Okinawa ain't exactly next door to Osaka."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid ""
"Damn! I had no idea the old lady was so famous! Well, it's not polite to "
"keep an old lady waiting, am I right? Guess it's time to head out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "700"
msgid ""
"After Osaka, it's straight to Tokyo. I know a few great clubs up there, so "
"track me down if you end up sightseeing in Tokyo or something."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "712"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "760"
msgid "Damn! Were you actually tryin' to kill me? I like your style, man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "772"
msgid ""
"You're definitely the real thing, Yonashiro-san. Can you teach me another "
"weapon later?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "784"
msgid ""
"Hahaha! Careful, Kiryu-san, you might just stop my heart sayin' stuff like "
"that! Or hittin' me the way you do. Either one, really. And that's why I "
"like ya!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "796"
msgid ""
"Oh, and I promised you a fancy certificate and everything, didn't I? Here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "808"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>Nunchaku Master Certificate<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "832"
msgid ""
"Show this to Kamiyama. That little piggy'll crap his pants, hehe. Even "
"better, he'll sell you some nunchaku. Ain't that great?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "844"
msgid ""
"I hear he can even make you a custom pair if ya got the designs and "
"materials. Ask him for the details, though. I only know about beatin' fools "
"with 'em, not makin' em."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "856"
msgid ""
"Anyway, I gotta say, you've really grown on me, Kiryu-san. Grown on me like "
"that tumor my momma has."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "868"
msgid ""
"And sometimes it's best to keep teachin' tumors martial arts! That's why "
"I've decided to stay here. That means you can train with me anytime you "
"like! Hahaha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "928"
msgid "Damn! Were you actually tryin' to kill me? I like your style, man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "940"
msgid ""
"Keep trainin' and come back. Beat me, and I'll give you a Master "
"Certificate. Can't give it to you if I'm dead, though, so maybe ease up a "
"little."
msgstr ""

