msgstr ""

msgctxt "1120"
msgid "Yeah, I'm ready."
msgstr "Sì, sono pronto."

msgctxt "1132"
msgid "All right! That's what I like to hear!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1192"
msgid ""
"So there's one itty bitty thing I need to know first. What kind of weapons "
"can you already use?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1204"
msgid ""
"Well, I guess I only know two real techniques: the sword technique I learned"
" from an old man and the staff technique I learned from an old lady."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1216"
msgid "Everything else is self-taught, not that I can't hold my own."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1228"
msgid ""
"To get information about the weapons you can currently use, press "
"<Action:Button_Triangle@UI> on the Pause Menu's Upgrades screen to display "
"the Abilities screen, and look under \"Weapons.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1240"
msgid ""
"Hey, that's more than the chuckleheads that usually show up here know! I'm "
"guessin' you'll wanna focus on something you can't already crack skulls "
"with, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1252"
msgid "Sounds good."
msgstr "Mi sembra una buona idea."

msgctxt "1264"
msgid ""
"All right then... How about nunchaku? Pretty badass weapons if you ask me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1276"
msgid "Nunchaku?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1288"
msgid ""
"Nunchaku. A more iconic Okinawan weapon there ain't. Don't be fooled by "
"their imposing appearance. They might look devastatingly powerful, but "
"that's because they are!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1300"
msgid "Okay, nunchaku it is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1312"
msgid ""
"All right! Take off your shirt and get in the ring! No way you're gonna be "
"able to move the way you need to dressed like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1324"
msgid "Okay."
msgstr "Ok."

